  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "night-eater.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、うちのカフェに奇妙な名物ができた。名は「閉店後限定営業」という。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉店の札を出してからの一時間、夜の常連が集まる店になる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「天の川、点灯——客席の照明はいただきます。安全灯は残します」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "但し書きまで、彼女の一年の集大成だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今夜も店内は、閉店後だけ大繁盛だった。耳がにぎやかで、うれしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "天井には彼女の夜が広がり、常連が星座の下でカップを傾ける。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "延長を宣言した瞬間、拍手が起きて、椅子上げと掃除が始まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの常連は、世界一行儀がいい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……そろそろ、朝が来る。今夜の最後の仕事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外、東の空が白み始める。彼女は窓辺で、朝の最初の光を、ひとくちだけつまみ食いした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "行儀のいい一口。それで夜が、三分だけ延びる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "朝の一口目は、焼きたてのパンの味。……三分の延長は、この店の分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "延長三分で、何をするんですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "決まってる。——最後の二杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.epilogue.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "常連たちが帰った店内に、食べ残された最後の一灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その下に、カップが二つ。夜の最後の三分間は、いつも二人分の貸切だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "安全灯の緑と、彼女の夜の藍色が、カップの中で少し混ざる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今夜の総評。営業、星五つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "閉店作業、星五つ。……この三分は、星、つけない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "つけないんですか?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "格付けは、比べるためのもの。……比べるものが無い時間には、つけられないの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食レポの人の、最上級のほめ言葉だった。朝が窓まで来て、夜の裾が名残惜しそうに床を撫でる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.epilogue.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「また今夜」と言い合える閉店。この一年でいちばんの発明だと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "night-eater.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
